OL,3,GNEWSALonger hospital ambulance journeys
OL,4,Araise concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanges to where some ambulance
OL,7,Fpatients in Devon are taken for
OL,8,Femergency treatment have prompted
OL,9,Fconcerns about longer journeys and
OL,10,Faccess to care.
OL,12,FPatients in postcode areas EX36, EX20
OL,13,Fand EX22 who call an ambulance may now
OL,14,Fbe taken to the Royal Devon and Exeter
OL,15,FHospital rather than North Devon
OL,16,FDistrict Hospital (NDDH) in Barnstaple.
OL,18,FOne GP told the BBC some patients were
OL,19,Fconcerned about being taken further
OL,20,Ffrom home and questioned the impact on
OL,21,Fambulance availability in rural areas.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
