OL,3,GNEWSALonger hospital ambulance journeys
OL,4,Araise concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,7,FNHS Foundation Trust said the changes,
OL,8,Fintroduced on 27 July, were designed to
OL,9,Freduce pressure on services, improve
OL,10,Faccess to treatment and cut waiting
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
